  id: clue_manuscript
  title: The Final Manuscript
  description: 'The final pages reveal that Edmund discovered someone had been using
    his identity. He planned to disappear to expose the truth. The photograph proves
    he was still alive ten years after his supposed disappearance. But the final
    page contains one last message: "If you are reading this, the person who sent
    you here knows where you are."'
